    <li>tale_noun->ﺎًﻗﺎﺸﻋ ﺎﺤﺒﺻﺃ [ACCEPTER_nameDef] ﻭ [PURSUER_nameDef]</li>
    <li>image->[circumstance_group] [ACCEPTER_nameFull] ﻥﺫﺃ ﻲﻓ ﺔﻔﻴﻄﻟ ﺀﺎﻴﺷﺄﺑ ﺲﻤﻬﻳ [PURSUER_nameFull]</li>
    <li>image->[circumstance_group] ﺵﺍﺮﻔﻟﺍ ﻮﺤﻧ ﺪﻴﻟﺎﺑ [ACCEPTER_nameFull] ﺩﻮﻘﻳ [PURSUER_nameFull]</li>
    <li>image->[circumstance_group] [ACCEPTER_nameFull] ﻊﻣ ﺮﻳﺮﺴﻟﺍ ﻰﻠﻋ ﺰﻔﻘﻳ [PURSUER_nameFull]</li>
    <li>image->[circumstance_group] [ACCEPTER_nameFull] ﻒﻐﺸﺑ ﻞّﺒﻘُﻳ [PURSUER_nameFull]</li>
    <li>circumstance_phrase->ﻝﻮﻘﻌﻣ ﺮﻴﻏ ﻞﻜﺸﺑ ﺮﻴﺒﻛ ﺮﻳﺮﺳ ﻲﻓ</li>
    <li>circumstance_phrase->ﺕﺍﺀﺎﻠﻤﻟﺍ ﻦﻴﺑ</li>
    <li>circumstance_phrase->ﻥﺎﻴﻌﻠﻟ ﺓﺮﻫﺎﻇ ﺔﻠﻴﻠﻗ ﺲﺑﺎﻠﻤﺑ</li>
    <li>circumstance_phrase->ﻕﺮﻌﻟﺎﺑ ﻰﻄﻐﻣ ﺎﻤﻫﺎﻠﻛ ﺎﻤﻨﻴﺑ</li>
    <li>desc_sentence->.[ACCEPTER_nameDef] ﺭﺍﻮﺠﺑ ﻦﻀﺘﺤﻳ [PURSUER_nameDef]</li>
    <li>desc_sentence->ﺕﺍﺮﻈﻨﻟﺍ ﻥﺎﻟﺩﺎﺒﺘﻳ [ACCEPTER_nameDef] ﻭ [PURSUER_nameDef]</li>
    <li>desc_sentence->.[ACCEPTER_nameDef] ﻥﺫﺃ ﻲﻓ ﺦﻔﻨﻳ [PURSUER_nameDef]</li>
    <li>desc_sentence->.[ACCEPTER_nameDef] ﻊﻣ ﺏﻮﻠﺳﺄﺑ ﻂﺒﺗﺮﻳ [PURSUER_nameDef]</li>
    <li>desc_sentence->.[ACCEPTER_nameDef] ﻞﺜﻣ ﺎًﻣﺎﻤﺗ ﻞﻌﻔﻳ [PURSUER_nameDef]</li>
    <li>desc_sentence->ﻒﻨﻌﺑ[ACCEPTER_nameDef] ﺓﻮﻘﺑ ﺲﻤﻠﻳ [PURSUER_nameDef]</li>
