    <li>image->[circumstance_group] ﻑﺎﻓﺰﻟﺍ ﻞﻔﺣ ﻝﺎﻠﺧ [SPOUSE2_nameFull] ﺪﻴﺑ ﺎًﺜﺒﺸﺘﻣ [SPOUSE1_nameFull]</li>
    <li>circumstance_phrase->ﺐﻴﻬﻣ ﻞﻔﺣ ﻲﻓ</li>
