    <li>circumstance_phrase->ﺭﺎﻗﻮﺑ ﻥﻭﺮﺧﺂﻟﺍ ﺐﻗﺍﺮﻳ ﺎﻤﻨﻴﺑ</li>
    <li>desc_sentence->.[SPOUSE2_nameDef] ﻦﻀﺘﺤﻳ [SPOUSE1_nameDef]</li>
    <li>desc_sentence->.ﺕﺍﺮﻈﻨﻟﺍ ﻥﺎﻟﺩﺎﺒﺘﻳ [SPOUSE2_nameDef] ﻭ [SPOUSE1_nameDef]</li>
    <li>desc_sentence->.[SPOUSE2_nameDef] ﻥﺫﺃ ﻲﻓ ﺲﻤﻬﻳ [SPOUSE1_nameDef]</li>
    <li>desc_sentence->.[SPOUSE2_nameDef] ﻊﻣ ﻖﻴﻧﺃ ﻞﻜﺸﺑ ﻂﺒﺗﺮﻣ [SPOUSE1_nameDef]</li>
    <li>desc_sentence->.[SPOUSE2_nameDef] ﻞﺜﻣ ﺎًﻣﺎﻤﺗ ﻞﻌﻔﻳ [SPOUSE1_nameDef]</li>
    <li>desc_sentence->ﻒﻨﻌﺑ[SPOUSE2_nameDef] ﺓﻮﻘﺑ ﺲﻤﻠﻳ [SPOUSE1_nameDef]</li>
